---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Best Time to Visit Lake View Park"
  description="Best time to visit Lake View Park Islamabad: season, time of day and weather guidance to avoid heat, crowds and storms."
  path="/best-time-to-visit/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What is the best season for Lake View Park?', a: 'Cooler months are most comfortable for walking and picnics. Islamabad summers are hot, so shift outdoor time to early morning or evening and carry water and sun protection.' },
    { q: 'What time of day is calmest?', a: 'Weekday mornings and early afternoons are calmer; evenings are lovely but busier, especially at weekends. Avoid peak weekends and public holidays if you prefer smaller crowds.' },
    { q: 'How do I check weather and warnings?', a: 'Use the park weather guidance and any official PMD warnings. A forecast does not announce closures, but rain, thunderstorms and strong wind affect paths and water activities.' },
    { q: 'Can I time my visit to a fixed schedule?', a: 'Gate and activity hours are not CDA-confirmed, so choose your time for comfort and crowds rather than a fixed timetable. Verify the live details before you travel.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Best time to visit', href: '/best-time-to-visit/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Weekend guide', href: '/weekend-guide/' },
    { label: 'Picnic guide', href: '/picnic-guide/' },
    { label: 'Sunset visit', href: '/sunset-visit/' },
    { label: 'Rainy day guide', href: '/rainy-day-guide/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">The “best” time depends on whether you want calm space, soft light or cooler weather. Here are the patterns visitors report, with the caveats that matter.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Season</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Cooler months are the most comfortable for walking and picnics. Islamabad summers are hot, so shift outdoor time to early morning or evening and carry water and sun protection.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Time of day</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Weekday mornings and early afternoons are calmer. Evenings are lovely for lake and sunset views but busier, especially at weekends. Avoid peak weekends and public holidays if you prefer smaller crowds.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Weather watch</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Use <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/#weather">the park weather guidance</a> and any official PMD warnings. A forecast does not announce closures, but rain, thunderstorms and strong wind affect paths and water activities.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">No official schedule to time around</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">Gate and activity hours are not CDA-confirmed (see <a class="underline" href="/opening-hours/">opening hours</a>), so choose your visit time for comfort and crowds rather than a fixed timetable.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Pick for comfort, not a schedule</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Because gate and activity hours aren’t CDA-confirmed, the smartest plan is to choose a time that suits the weather and the crowds. Cooler months, weekday mornings and a weather check beat chasing a fixed clock.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Best-time-to-visit checklist" items={[
      'Prefer cooler months; avoid midday summer heat.',
      'Choose weekday mornings or early afternoons for calm.',
      'Check the weather and any PMD warnings first.',
      'Don’t rely on a fixed timetable — verify hours on arrival.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
